# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `pnpm preview` (opennextjs-cloudflare
# preview). Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). On stage and prod it is the
# product's optional Orun secret DEEPGRAM_API_KEY, which the deploy pushes to
# the Worker (tooling/wire/worker-secrets.mjs). Without it the page transcribes
# on Workers AI (the AI binding; `wrangler dev` reaches it only when you are
# logged in to Cloudflare, since Workers AI has no local mode).
DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
